# Agent tooling, not application source.
#
# `npx skills add` installs third-party skill packs here — design guidance for
# whoever happens to be pairing with an AI, unrelated to what the app does and
# unread by anything that runs. The packs themselves stay out of the repo so a
# checkout is about the product; skills-lock.json is committed instead, since
# it is what reproduces the same set (`npx skills install`).
.agents/
.claude/
